hat went wrong - and clean up the mess. Collect samples, erase evidence, and secure containment at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/aceef29beb8441c658a9ae813ac50443.poster.avif?t=1771871566\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/aceef29beb8441c658a9ae813ac50443.webm?t=1771871566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/aceef29beb8441c658a9ae813ac50443.mp4?t=1771871566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Living, Mutating Hostiles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face intelligent, physically simulated enemies that dodge, adapt and mutate mid-combat. The deeper you descend, the more grotesque and dangerous they become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/e9cb1a5a7460c99f1c443d115d0f62d1.poster.avif?t=1771871566\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/e9cb1a5a7460c99f1c443d115d0f62d1.webm?t=1771871566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/e9cb1a5a7460c99f1c443d115d0f62d1.mp4?t=1771871566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Your Supplies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are finite, and waste is punished. Loot the facility, craft what you need, and ration ammunition carefully. Your survival depends on managing both your own supplies and those of your squad.</p><p class=